      "url": "https://www.nationalgeographic.com/travel/article/vice-president-biden-travel-memories",
      "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"67d503a24633fcf9\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nOwen Finnegan immigrated from Ireland with his family around 1841 ... It was an amazing … six-day trip. I’m so glad my grandchildren were there to taste it. GS: Travel is something that can be shared ... and that’s really the theme of the next image that you chose. Here you are in Baghdad, Iraq, with your son, Captain Beau Biden.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"67d503a24633fcf9\">>>",
