      "title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"87f3548038712c0e\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nVice President Biden Visits Afghanistan, Pakistan, and Iraq | The White House\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"87f3548038712c0e\">>>",
      "url": "https://obamawhitehouse.archives.gov/photos-and-video/photogallery/vice-president-biden-visits-afghanistan-pakistan-and-iraq",
      "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"e6cdb8a233414a49\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nVice President Joe Biden traveled to Afghanistan, Pakistan, and Iraq last week. In Afghanistan, the Vice President assessed progress toward the transition to Afghan-led security beginning this year. In Islamabad, he met with leaders to discuss the U.S.-Pakistan bilateral relationship and how the two countries can work together towards peace and stability in the region. Finally, Vice President Biden made his first visit to Iraq since political leaders and the Council of Representatives formed a new, inclusive national partnership government in December.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"e6cdb8a233414a49\">>>",
